window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>It is finished... Sweat dripping off her brow as the threads started long ago start to fuse together.</p> <p>It’s time to make plans, hide the truth, and get the HELL off her throne.</p> <p>But how to accomplish creating a federation when those coming together want to gut her empire?</p> <p>Anyone who understands the Queen Bitch knows she won't accept that condition without a fight.</p> <p>However, to accomplish meeting her love again in a system far away, she will accomplish the impossible.</p> <p>Her eyes start to glow red.</p> <p>No one will stop her from getting back to Michael.</p> <p>Adapted from the novel and produced with a full cast of actors, immersive sound effects and cinematic music!</p> <p>Performed by Colleen Delany, Emily Beresford, Michael John Casey, Rob McFadyen, James Lewis, Amanda Forstrom, Mort Shelby, Anthony Palmini, Rita Amparita, Danny Gavigan, Matthew Pauli, Bianca Bryan, Stephane Nameth-Parker, Torian Brackett, Ryan Dalusung, Rayner Gabriel, Jonathan Lee Taylor, Tyler Hyrchuk, Sandi Stock, Eva Wilhelm, Christopher Graybill, Daniel Llaca, Nicole Perez, Michael Glenn, Lise Bruneau, Su Ling Chan, David Cui Cui, Sara Matsui-Colby, Jonathon Church, Nickolette Kong, Tanja Milojevic, K’lai Rivera, Debi Tinsley, Mark Harrietha, Julie-Ann Elliot, Wyn Delano, Terence Aselford, Ken Jackson, Yasmin Tuazon, Donald Guzzi, James Konicek, Bradley Foster Smith, Christopher Walker, Nora Achrati, Emlyn McFarland, Karen Novack, Steve Wannall, Christopher Williams, David Zitney, Drew Kopas, and Matthew Bassett.</p>"; 
